--- .gitignore (原始)
Nothing should be ignored since only Python source files (.py) were added and no build artifacts, dependencies, or temporary files are present in the changes.

+++ .gitignore (修改后)
```
# Compressed files
*.zip

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
*.env.*

# Logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python
*.so
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
dist/
build/
.coverage
coverage/
htmlcov/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.tox/
nox/
```